蓬莱 · Penglai
================

Penglai (蓬莱) is a downstream *distribution* of GenericAgent — the GA execution
core is kept upstream-first and Penglai capabilities live in additive files,
runtime plugins, wrappers, and channel adapters. This NOTICE records the
copyright and brand boundaries that the single root LICENSE (upstream MIT) does
not, by itself, make obvious to license scanners or downstream users.


